  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> , </span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">has release the Interview Admit Card for the Security Guard, Reporter, Assistant, DEO &amp; Various Other Posts. This recruitment was released for 176 posts. Applications for the Bihar Vidhan Parishad Various Posts Recruitment 2024 were accepted from <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">16 October 2024</span>, to <span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">25 October 2024</span>. The Security Guard physical examination was conducted on 21 to 28 April 2026. Candidates who had appeared in this Examination can download their Bihar Vidhan Parishad Security Guard Interview Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"google-anno-skip google-anno-sc\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"Police exam prep\" data-google-vignette=\"false\" data-google-interstitial=\"false\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad (BVP), Government of Bihar</span></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad Security Guard Interview Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt. No: 01/2023, 02/2023, 03/2023 &amp; 04/2023</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>25 July 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>21 August 2023&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Online Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>22 August 2023</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Form Re Open</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>16 October 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>25 October 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Online Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>25 October 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Physical Exam Date :&nbsp;<b>21-28 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Physical Admit Card Available On : <b>15 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PET Result : <strong>22 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Interview Admit Card : <strong>08 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Advt </strong>:<strong> 01/2023 &amp; 02/2023&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC, EWS, Other State :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Advt : 03/2023&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC, EWS, Other State :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 800/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Advt : 04/2023&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC, EWS, Other State : <strong>Rs. 300/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 150/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Various Posts Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 January 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 – 21 Years (Post Wise)</strong></span></li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>37 Years</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Bihar Vidhan Parishad Various Posts Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Various Posts 2023 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Posts : 176 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Reporter</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">16</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">30</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Caretaker</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Data Entry Operator (DEO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">40</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lower Division Clerk (LDC)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">09</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Security Guard</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">56</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Driver</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Office Attendant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">06</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Office Attendant (Watchman)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Office Attendant (Faras)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">06</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Office Attendant (Sweeper)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">03</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Office Attendant (Mali)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Various Posts Recruitment 2023 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Reporter</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from any recognized Institute / University with Stenographer Speed of 150 WPM in Hindi &amp; Computer Typing Speed of 35 WPM in Hindi and English (Both)&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate should also have O Level Or Equivalent Degree.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from any recognized Institute / University with Hindi and English Typing 30 wpm &amp; have O Level Or Equivalent Degree will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Caretaker</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have Bachelor Degree in Any Stream from any recognized Institute / University with with O Level Or Equivalent Degree will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Data Entry Operator (DEO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their class 12th Examination from any recognized Board in India with Computer 8000 Key Depression Per Hours &amp; O Level Or Equivalent Degree will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Lower Division Clerk (LDC)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their class 12th Examination from any recognized Board in India with Computer Typing Hindi &amp; English 30 WPM&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;O Level Or Equivalent Degree will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Security Guard</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their class 12th Examination from any recognized Board in India with Male Height of 167.5 cms, Female Height of 154.6 cms&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Driver</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their class 10th Examination from any recognized Board in India with Valid LMV / HMV Driving License&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Office Attendant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their class 10th Examination from any recognized Board in India with Hindi / English Knowledge &amp; Cycling Ability&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Office Attendant (Watchman)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their class 10th Examination from any recognized Board in India with Hindi / English Knowledge &amp; Cycling Ability&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Office Attendant (Faras)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their class 10th Examination from any recognized Board in India with Hindi / English Knowledge &amp; Cycling Ability&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Office Attendant (Sweeper)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their class 10th Examination from any recognized Board in India with Hindi / English Knowledge &amp; Cycling Ability&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0819%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Office Attendant (Mali)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.9181%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their class 10th Examination from any recognized Board in India with Hindi / English Knowledge &amp; Cycling Ability&nbsp;will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download Bihar Vidhan Parishad Security Guard Interview Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In order to download their Bihar Vidhan Parishad Security Guard Interview Admit Card candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their Bihar Vidhan Parishad Security Guard Interview Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates will be redirected to Login Page, Here they have to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration No. /Login ID/Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Password/DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Verification Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to download their Bihar Vidhan Parishad Security Guard Interview Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can also download their Interview Admit Card from official site of the Bihar Vidhan Parishad.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Various Posts Recruitment 2023 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written E